From dcc4de01989bb474cac40b2301747af50c0f5da3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ahmad Bagus <ahmad@myjap.local>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 00:01:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(leave): tambah filter/search/pagination, upload lampiran
 asli, dan endpoint approve/reject terpisah

- StoreLeaveRequest & UpdateLeaveRequest: attachment kini validasi file (pdf/jpg/jpeg/png max 2MB), hapus field status/approved_by dari request (dipindah ke endpoint approve/reject)
- LeaveController@index: filter employee_id, status, leave_type, rentang tanggal, search nama karyawan/alasan, pagination
- LeaveController@store: handle file upload, status default Pending
- LeaveController@update: hanya bisa edit saat status Pending, auto hapus lampiran lama saat diganti
- LeaveController@approve & reject: endpoint baru, approved_by diambil dari auth user bukan input client, reject wajib isi alasan
- LeaveController@destroy: larang hapus cuti yang sudah Approved
- routes/api.php: tambah POST leaves/{id}/approve dan leaves/{id}/reject
---
